                                    <h1>Jewelry Shopify Development Agency &amp;mdash; Vertical Specialist Checklist (2026) | ITD GrowthLabs</h1>
                                    <div style="background:#fff7ed;border-left:4px solid #ff5722;padding:20px 24px;border-radius:10px;margin:24px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#334155;"><strong style="color:#ea580c;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:0.4px;">ITD JEWELRY PORTFOLIO &mdash; THE EVIDENCE:</strong><br>This article is written from live jewelry vertical work. ITD GrowthLabs is a specialist <a href="/industries/digital-marketing-for-jewelry-brands.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">digital marketing agency for jewelry brands</a> with a delivered <a href="/resources/Fabelia_Jewelry_D2C_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Fabelia jewelry D2C case study</a>, 8+ published jewelry playbooks including <a href="/resources/Gold_vs_Diamond_Jewelry_D2C_Strategy_2026.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Gold vs Diamond D2C Strategy</a>, <a href="/resources/Jewelry_D2C_Digital_Transformation_India_Dubai_2026.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Jewelry D2C Digital Transformation India + Dubai</a>, <a href="/resources/Best_D2C_Jewellery_Brands_UAE_GCC_2026_2027.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Best D2C Jewellery Brands UAE + GCC</a>, and city-specific jewelry marketing pages across <a href="/services/gcc/dubai-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Dubai</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/abu-dhabi-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Abu Dhabi</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/jeddah-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Jeddah</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/doha-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Doha</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/dammam-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Dammam</a>, and <a href="/services/gcc/al-khobar-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Al Khobar</a>. Every framework below is grounded in live category work &mdash; not generic D2C theory.</div><p>A jewelry Shopify store is not a generic e-com Shopify store. Category-specific requirements (360&deg; product view, AR try-on, video, BIS + HUID display, high-value payment, insurance-integrated checkout, video consultation, wishlist retargeting) determine whether a launched store converts at 2-4% (specialist build) or 0.5-1.2% (generic build).</p><p>This piece is the 15-point checklist we recommend jewelry founders use to evaluate any Shopify development agency before signing.</p>
                                    <h2>15-point jewelry Shopify agency evaluation checklist</h2>
                                    <p>Score each candidate agency on these 15 dimensions:</p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li><strong>1. Named jewelry Shopify sites built:</strong> Live URLs you can inspect. Not screenshots.</li><li><strong>2. Theme customisation depth:</strong> Prestige + Impulse + custom themes shipped. Not just Dawn config.</li><li><strong>3. 360&deg; product view integration:</strong> WebRotate 360 or Spinifex or native carousel. Not just static gallery.</li><li><strong>4. AR try-on integration:</strong> MirrAR + Jewelfie + Perfect Corp + Wanna. Live examples on their portfolio sites.</li><li><strong>5. Product video + Reels integration:</strong> Multi-angle 15-30 second SKU videos on product pages.</li><li><strong>6. Zoom + macro detail:</strong> Hallmark + stone-setting + prong-finishing visible on click.</li><li><strong>7. BIS + HUID + IGI + GIA display + PDF download:</strong> Certificate integration on SKU pages.</li><li><strong>8. Wishlist + save-for-later:</strong> Growave + Wishlist Plus + retargeting flow setup.</li><li><strong>9. Video consultation widget:</strong> Calendly + WhatsApp click-to-chat integration on SKU + collection pages.</li><li><strong>10. WhatsApp Cloud API integration:</strong> Interakt + AiSensy setup + broadcast + booking flow.</li><li><strong>11. High-value payment gateway setup:</strong> Razorpay + Cashfree enhanced-limits + EMI + BNPL + insurance-integrated checkout.</li><li><strong>12. Multi-currency + multi-region:</strong> INR + AED + SAR + USD + GBP support for GCC + international.</li><li><strong>13. Multi-language support:</strong> Hindi + Arabic + English for India + GCC brands.</li><li><strong>14. Schema + SEO foundation:</strong> Product + Organization + LocalBusiness + FAQPage + BreadcrumbList JSON-LD.</li><li><strong>15. Analytics + attribution:</strong> GA4 + Meta Pixel + Conversion API + WhatsApp CTWA + CRM sync.</li></ul><p>Score 60-75 = short-list. Below 50 = walk away.</p>
                                    <h2>Shopify Plus vs regular Shopify &amp;mdash; when each fits</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Regular Shopify (Rs 3-8 lakh build):</strong> Right for Rs 25L-Rs 2 Cr / month revenue brands. 100-500 SKUs. Standard Shopify Payments + custom theme + core apps stack. Handles 10K-100K monthly sessions.</p><p><strong>Shopify Plus (Rs 8-25 lakh build + Rs 2K USD / month Shopify Plus subscription):</strong> Right for Rs 2-25 Cr / month revenue brands. 500-5000 SKUs. Advanced Shopify Payments + Launchpad + Script Editor + custom checkout + wholesale channel + B2B features. Handles 100K-1M+ monthly sessions.</p><p><strong>Headless Shopify (Hydrogen + Next.js frontend, Rs 12-25 lakh+):</strong> Right for Rs 5 Cr+ / month revenue brands. Performance-critical + custom-feature-heavy + multi-region. Requires ongoing dev retainer (Rs 50K-Rs 2 lakh / month).</p><p>Choose based on current + 24-month projected revenue + SKU count + feature complexity. Most jewelry brands start on regular Shopify + migrate to Plus at Rs 2 Cr+ / month.</p>
                                    <h2>Build timeline + realistic expectations</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Boutique / Starter jewelry Shopify (Rs 2-4 lakh):</strong> 4-6 weeks. Premium theme + core apps + 30-80 SKUs + basic customisation + WhatsApp setup.</p><p><strong>Mid-market fine + fashion Shopify (Rs 4-8 lakh):</strong> 6-10 weeks. Premium theme + full apps stack + 100-300 SKUs + AR + video consultation + Klaviyo + advanced WhatsApp.</p><p><strong>Enterprise fine + bridal + luxury Shopify (Rs 8-15 lakh):</strong> 10-16 weeks. Custom theme + advanced apps + multi-region + Arabic + Hindi + 300+ SKUs + full concierge + insurance.</p><p><strong>Headless Shopify (Rs 12-25 lakh):</strong> 12-18 weeks. Enterprise scale only. Ongoing dev retainer required.</p><p>Content + photography + video is separate (Rs 2-8 lakh additional).</p>
                                    <h2>Post-launch retainer + support requirements</h2>
                                    <p>Shopify build is not a one-time project. Post-launch retainer needs:</p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li><strong>Ongoing feature development:</strong> New collections + landing pages + campaign integrations. Rs 25-80K / month typical.</li><li><strong>App + theme + Shopify version updates:</strong> Quarterly maintenance to keep apps + theme + Shopify current.</li><li><strong>CRO + A/B testing:</strong> Ongoing conversion optimisation via Shopify Scripts + apps. Rs 30-1L lakh / month.</li><li><strong>Bug fixes + support:</strong> 24-48 hour SLA on critical issues.</li><li><strong>Analytics + attribution audit:</strong> Quarterly review to ensure GA4 + Meta Pixel + CRM sync working.</li></ul><p>Post-launch retainer typically Rs 40-1.5 lakh / month depending on complexity + iteration cadence. Growth-tier brands often bundle Shopify dev + marketing retainer with same agency for continuity.</p>
                                    <h2>ITD GrowthLabs jewelry Shopify approach</h2>
                                    <p>ITD delivers jewelry-specialist Shopify builds combining category-specific feature depth with pan-D2C engineering scale. Our approach: theme customisation on Prestige + Impulse + custom, full jewelry app stack (360 + AR + WhatsApp + insurance + video consultation), BIS + HUID + certification display, high-value payment + EMI + BNPL setup, multi-region (India + GCC + international) support, and post-launch marketing + retainer continuity.</p><p>See our <a href="/resources/jewelry_shopify_store_template_apps_stack.php">jewelry Shopify build playbook</a> for the full technical framework + <a href="/industries/digital-marketing-for-jewelry-brands.php">jewelry vertical page</a> for engagement model + pricing.</p>

