                                        <h3 style="color:#fff;margin-bottom:15px;">Ready to Get Started?</h3>
                                        <p style="color:#ccc;margin-bottom:25px;">Book a free 30-minute jewelry D2C discovery call. We map your brand + funnel + share a customised proposal within 3 working days.</p>
                                        <a href="https://www.itdgrowthlabs.com/contact-us.php" style="background:#ff5722;color:#fff;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;display:inline-block;margin-right:10px;">Contact Us Today</a>
                                        <a href="https://calendly.com/itdgrowthlabs-info/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="js-book-call" data-source="blog_cta" style="background:#1565c0;color:#fff;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;display:inline-block;">Book Free 30-min Call</a>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is the most important criterion when choosing a jewelry Shopify development agency?</h3>
                                        <p>Named jewelry Shopify sites built (live URLs you can inspect). If they can't point to real jewelry Shopify stores they've built, they don't have jewelry-vertical Shopify experience &mdash; category-specific requirements (AR, 360, BIS display, video consultation, insurance) will bite you post-launch.</p>
                                        <h3>Should we go with Shopify Plus or regular Shopify for our jewelry brand?</h3>
                                        <p>Regular Shopify for Rs 25L-2 Cr / month revenue. Shopify Plus for Rs 2-25 Cr / month. Headless (Hydrogen + Next.js) for Rs 5 Cr+ / month performance-critical + custom-feature-heavy + multi-region. Choose based on current + 24-month projected revenue + SKU count + feature complexity.</p>
                                        <h3>How long does a jewelry Shopify store take to build?</h3>
                                        <p>4-6 weeks boutique (Rs 2-4L). 6-10 weeks mid-market (Rs 4-8L). 10-16 weeks enterprise (Rs 8-15L). 12-18 weeks headless (Rs 12-25L). Content + photography + video separate (Rs 2-8L additional).</p>
                                        <h3>What apps must a jewelry Shopify store have?</h3>
                                        <p>Klaviyo + Interakt / AiSensy WhatsApp + Judge.me / Yotpo reviews + Growave / Wishlist Plus + Route / Corso insurance + WebRotate 360 + MirrAR AR try-on + Loox post-purchase reviews. Total Rs 30-80K / month tooling. Optional: Bold Subscriptions for daily-wear + accessories.</p>
                                        <h3>Do jewelry brands need multi-currency + multi-language Shopify setup?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes if targeting GCC + international expansion. INR + AED + SAR + USD + GBP multi-currency + Hindi + Arabic + English multi-language. Shopify Markets or Shopify Plus advanced settings. Adds 2-4 weeks + Rs 1-3 lakh to build.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the realistic Shopify post-launch retainer for a jewelry brand?</h3>
                                        <p>Rs 40K-1.5 lakh / month depending on complexity + iteration cadence. Covers ongoing feature development + app + theme + Shopify version updates + CRO + A/B testing + bug fixes + analytics audit. Growth-tier brands often bundle Shopify dev + marketing retainer with same agency.</p>
                                        <h3>How much should we budget for jewelry Shopify build + first year?</h3>
                                        <p>Rs 4-15 lakh initial build + Rs 5-18 lakh first-year post-launch retainer (Rs 40K-1.5 lakh / month). Total Rs 9-33 lakh first-year for jewelry Shopify + operational continuity. Add Rs 2-8 lakh for photography + video content + Rs 8-25K / month for tooling apps.</p>
                                        <h3>Does ITD GrowthLabs build jewelry Shopify stores + also run marketing?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes end-to-end. Shopify build + jewelry-specific app stack + post-launch retainer + marketing (paid + SEO + content + WhatsApp + influencer) all handled by one team. Continuity across build + growth + iteration. See our <a href="/industries/digital-marketing-for-jewelry-brands.php">jewelry vertical page</a> for full engagement model.</p>
